  "_doc": "Expansion 1 (Vharlen). The ZONE EVENT BOSS for Blackstrand: a Slagborn raid captain who beaches her longboats on the black sand. P1 'The Landing': a keel-axe cleave, flaming arrows from the boats, a boat-ram charge down a line, and the Ash Horn — a blast the size of the beach; hide behind a stack of harbour crates. P2 at 55% 'Burn the Boats': she stands behind a fire-rite ward while raiders pour off the boats — SET ALL THREE TARRED LONGBOATS ALIGHT (use them) to strand her raiders and break the ward. P3, a new health bar 'No Retreat': a stand-together stack, keel sweeps in four directions and a get-in-close ring. Soft enrage from 4 minutes, hard at 7.",
  "party": "Zone event, everyone nearby joins. Solo: not intended (three boats to burn under raiders, a stack that needs 3). 3-5: playable. 10+: intended. M5 scaling: health and raider adds by players enrolled; stack need = clamp(players/4, 2, 5).",
